  dialogue:
  - Look who finally decided to show up.
  - Here, drink this. It should make you feel better.
  - 'You can now attack using [LMB] and double jump by pressing [Space] twice.

'
  - 'Look at you all bright and shining. '
  - Thank you, Master Vitalis.
  - There was an attack on our Village again. Mushrooms are dangerously close.
  - Master... I don't want to hide anymore...
  - I understand Lelush.
  - I've teached you everything I could. I think you are ready, after all.. We need
    more hands to fight.
  - It's getting worse and worse each day. Some parts of the forest are dying without
    a sun.
  - Mushroom grow bigger and bigger covering all the sunlight and the sky.
  - I'll give you your first task - find Miss Tea-Badger. She went somewhere again...
    I hope she's alright.
  - I will do my best, Master!
  - '*You might notice that you glow to the beat now. When attacking on beat, you
    will deal bonus damage*'
